[I] Qt6 SCXML (state machine notation) compiler and related tools

[T] Qt SCXML is a Qt 6 module for creating state machines from State Chart
[T] XML (SCXML) files, providing the qscxmlc compiler and classes to embed
[T] them in C++ and QML applications.

